Error [E0024]: Jet doesn't use `catch`
  --> tests/ui/foreign_catch.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     catch;
    |     ^^^^^
 Why: handle a failure with `or` for a fallback, or test with `== err(...)`
 Fix: write `parse(x) or 0` or `if x == err(e) { ... }` instead of `catch`

Error [E0003]: expected a value, found `;`
  --> tests/ui/foreign_catch.jet:2:10
    |
  2 |     catch;
    |          ^
 Why: a value can be a name, a number, quoted text, `true`/`false`, or a call
 Fix: e.g. `x`, `42`, `3.5`, or `"hello"`
